msgid "The top of the degassing reactor can be located several meters above the entrance tank of the water treatment plant. The higher the tank (up to a max of 10 m) the more pronounced the pressure reduction will be and the more effective the reactor will be at degassing. The degassing reactor will produce a water and bubble effluent that must be"
